    "Single run per action; no warmup/repeat average.",
    "RGB MAD is motion/continuity proxy, not perceptual quality.",
    "Farneback flow is a signed image-space motion proxy, not action accuracy.",
    "Peak GPU combines model and activations; weights/KV/activation breakdown was not separately instrumented.",
    "Causal timing includes RGB anchor decode/re-encode and is not an isolated speedup claim."
  ]
}
